  "description": "ADO-TXN abandonment on a read/write Connection: BeginTrans and UPDATE S of ID 1 to \"rel\"; the Connection object is released with no CommitTrans, RollbackTrans or Close; after a 300 ms pause the stored row is read through a second ADO Connection, through DAO OpenDatabase and through a third ADO Connection after another pause (State and Errors of each); the file and lock-file state is recorded. Asks whether releasing an open transaction commits, rolls back or leaves it pending, and what a later opener sees.",
